  "2": "40 in every save from the opening to the endgame -- a fixed constant, not a collectible",
  "5": "aeion_max   -- 1000 throughout",
  "6": "energy      -- 89 against a save documented 89of99, then 999 late",
  "7": "missile     -- 13 / 13 / 155 / 157; also watched descend 12->0 while firing",
